sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Venue streams
  participant I as Ingest
  participant S as History store
  participant B as Envelope pipeline
  participant D as Detectors
  participant L as Forecast lab
  participant J as Journal
  participant A as API
  participant W as Dashboard
  loop every bar close
    V->>I: trades aggregated
    I->>S: candle upserted
    I->>B: market.candle packet
    B->>J: appended, generation bumps
    B->>D: fresh candles, refs checked
    D->>J: alerts and suspect list when fired
    B->>L: incremental re-score tick
    L->>J: forecast grades
  end
  W->>A: poll lab + suspects
  A-->>W: latest state, staleness quoted
